    "description": {
      "value": "<p><em>Wondrous Item, Uncommon (Requires Attunement by a Druid or Ranger)</em></p><p>This cloak shifts its color and texture to blend in with the terrain around you. While wearing it, you can use it as a Spellcasting Focus for your Druid and Ranger spells.</p><p>While you are in a Lightly Obscured area, you can take the Hide action as a Bonus Action, even if you are being directly observed.</p>",
